#: :1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Featherline is a thoughtful medication tracker built for people on long-term "
"hormone therapy who want to keep their personal records private."
msgstr ""
"Featherline is a thoughtful medication tracker built for people on long-term "
"hormone therapy who want to keep their personal records private."

#: :3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everything you log — doses, schedules, personal notes — stays in an "
"encrypted database on your device, under your control."
msgstr ""
"Everything you log — doses, schedules, personal notes — stays in an "
"encrypted database on your device, under your control."

#: :5
#, fuzzy
msgid "Track your routine, the way you actually live it"
msgstr "Track your routine, the way you actually live it"

#: :7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Build a personal medication schedule, daily or weekly. Get reminders at dose "
"times, with quick actions to mark doses as taken, log them later, or note "
"when you've taken something outside your plan. Your schedule, your records, "
"your pace."
msgstr ""
"Build a personal medication schedule, daily or weekly. Get reminders at dose "
"times, with quick actions to mark doses as taken, log them later, or note "
"when you've taken something outside your plan. Your schedule, your records, "
"your pace."

#: :9
#, fuzzy
msgid "Visualize your routine"
msgstr "Visualize your routine"

#: :11
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Featherline shows you how your dose timing flows across the day and week — a "
"7-day visualization helps you see patterns in your routine. Set your own "
"personal target ranges, mark your doses on a timeline, and check changes "
"over the past 24 hours when you want a closer look. You can also record "
"personal test results to keep your visualization meaningful to you."
msgstr ""
"Featherline shows you how your dose timing flows across the day and week — a "
"7-day visualization helps you see patterns in your routine. Set your own "
"personal target ranges, mark your doses on a timeline, and check changes "
"over the past 24 hours when you want a closer look. You can also record "
"personal test results to keep your visualization meaningful to you."

#: :13
#, fuzzy
msgid "Designed with privacy in mind"
msgstr "Designed with privacy in mind"

#: :15
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Local encrypted storage — your data stays on your device by default\n"
"- Optional app lock with biometrics or device password\n"
"- Optional screen content hiding for screenshots and recent apps\n"
"- Password-encrypted backup files you control — bring your records to a new "
"device or keep an external copy"
msgstr ""
"- Local encrypted storage — your data stays on your device by default\n"
"- Optional app lock with biometrics or device password\n"
"- Optional screen content hiding for screenshots and recent apps\n"
"- Password-encrypted backup files you control — bring your records to a new "
"device or keep an external copy"

#: :20
#, fuzzy
msgid "Features at a glance"
msgstr "Features at a glance"

#: :22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"- Custom medication schedules, daily or weekly\n"
"- Smart reminders with batch logging\n"
"- 7-day routine visualization\n"
"- Month-view history with personal summaries\n"
"- Personal record logging with built-in and custom fields\n"
"- Set you body weight for more personalized visualization\n"
"- Home screen widget — see your next dose and mark it taken right from your "
"home screen\n"
"- Medication stock tracking — keep count of what you have on hand, with low-"
"stock reminders and a runway estimate so you can reorder before you run out\n"
"- Daily journal — note how any day went and track meaningful dates with "
"milestones"
msgstr ""
"- Custom medication schedules, daily or weekly\n"
"- Smart reminders with batch logging\n"
"- 7-day routine visualization\n"
"- Month-view history with personal summaries\n"
"- Personal record logging with built-in and custom fields\n"
"- Set you body weight for more personalized visualization\n"
"- Home screen widget — see your next dose and mark it taken right from your "
"home screen\n"
"- Medication stock tracking — keep count of what you have on hand, with low-"
"stock reminders and a runway estimate so you can reorder before you run out\n"
"- Daily journal — note how any day went and track meaningful dates with "
"milestones"

#: :32
#, fuzzy
msgid "About Featherline"
msgstr "About Featherline"

#: :34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Featherline is a personal tracking tool, not a medical device. The "
"visualizations are based on the times and amounts you've logged, calculated "
"using publicly available models. They're meant to help you stay organized "
"and aware of your own routine. For any health decisions or interpretations, "
"always consult your healthcare provider."
msgstr ""
"Featherline is a personal tracking tool, not a medical device. The "
"visualizations are based on the times and amounts you've logged, calculated "
"using publicly available models. They're meant to help you stay organized "
"and aware of your own routine. For any health decisions or interpretations, "
"always consult your healthcare provider."
